{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:7ac3c37821905696","name":"Blockade Runner Talent Tree","source":{"id":"source:reference-7ac3c37821905696","title":"Blockade Runner Talent Tree","revision":16299,"timestamp":"2024-08-18T00:56:38Z","sha256":"708b6a5fa7fc1f63ab712bc46b26c3336994d5286f13f7fde8a64dabd61e6b45","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=16299","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Blockade%20Runner%20Talent%20Tree&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-7ac3c37821905696","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scum and Villainy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scum_and_Villainy"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["One of the most valued skills a pilot in the Fringe can have is the ability to blast past the authorities and not get caught. This Talent Tree covers abilities common to smugglers and blockade runners throughout the galaxy.\n"]},"\n\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Core Talents"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Close Cover"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Watch This"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["If you occupy the same space as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"}," that is larger than the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"}," you are ",{"tag":"a","children":["Piloting"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Piloting"},", your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"}," gains a +5 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Cover"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Cover"}," bonus from the larger ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Outrun"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Whenever you use the ",{"tag":"a","children":["All-Out Movement"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/All-Out_Movement","referenceId":"reference:c3e269326f94373b"}," Action as the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle Pilot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle_Pilot","referenceId":"reference:4aff6d0e54fff36e"}," of a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"},", your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"}," gains a +2 dodge bonus to its ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Punch Through"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["If you are the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle Pilot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle_Pilot","referenceId":"reference:4aff6d0e54fff36e"}," of a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"},", smaller ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicles"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicles"}," that attempt to engage you in a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dogfight"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dogfight","referenceId":"reference:d47b1a4208bcd07f"}," take a -10 penalty on their ",{"tag":"a","children":["Pilot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Pilot","referenceId":"reference:383e2d946278a872"}," checks, instead of the normal -5.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Small Target"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["When you are the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle Pilot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle_Pilot","referenceId":"reference:4aff6d0e54fff36e"}," of a Colossal or smaller ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Capital Ship"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Capital_Ship"}," weapons that take a -20 penalty on attack rolls against your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"}," (such as ",{"tag":"a","children":["Turbolasers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Turbolasers"},") do not automatically score a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Critical Hit"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Critical_Hit"}," on your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"}," on a Natural 20. The attack is only a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Critical Hit"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Critical_Hit"}," if the total attack roll (20 + the weapon's attack bonus) would normally hit your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"},". Otherwise, the attack deals normal damage.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Watch This"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["You can move into or through a space occupied by a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"}," of Colossal (Frigate) size or larger without causing a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Collision"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Collision"},". Additionally, if you are the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle Pilot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle_Pilot","referenceId":"reference:4aff6d0e54fff36e"}," of a Colossal or smaller ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"},", you can occupy the same space as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"}," of Colossal (Frigate) size or larger.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
